# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# The anti-copy value here is `X-Frame-Options` + `frame-ancestors`: together they stop the
# common "clone" that is really just someone iframing your site inside their own domain. They do
# NOT stop a real copy — see NUVEN/website-template/ANTI-COPY.md. `X-Robots-Tag: noai` is advisory and honoured by a
# minority of crawlers; it costs one line and is worth having alongside robots.txt.
#
# CSP is deliberately loose on img/font/style because these sites load Google Fonts and remote
# photography. Tighten per site if that changes.
#
# `frame-src` is required for the Google Maps embed on /contact. Without it frame-src falls back
# to `default-src 'self'` and the browser refuses the map with "This content is blocked.
# Contact the site owner to fix the issue." It does not weaken `frame-ancestors`, which is what
# actually stops other people iframing this site.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; frame-src https://www.google.com https://maps.google.com; form-action 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://api.nuvenhub.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; connect-src 'self' https://api.nuvenhub.com
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  X-Robots-Tag: noai, noimageai
